{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上一百十二\n字，照補註增入。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "表白舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾和畢，行人祝水文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾同聲誦大悲神呪，表白舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦真言時，調伏身心，想頂臍兩處具唵𫬠二字，令清淨故，以表\n福智圓滿。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦真言時，用右手無名指搵取香水，彈灑虛空并塗掌，想壇膓內外\n悉令清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦真言時，手拈花米三次，想成光明，種出生金銀璧玉珍\n寶之雲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦真言時，手拈花米灑在鈴杵上，想成智慧種。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "持杵振鈴語。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "置鈴於案，右手取花米，誦云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "將手持的花米散灑虗空，想所落花米悉\n成華香供養等雲。撫尺一下，誦云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾同和"}
