{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "置鈴於案，用右手無名指取香水彈灑曼拏囉上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彈三徧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次右手無名指取香水，於曼拏囉上右旋作一圓\n相，表福智圓滿故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "就念真言一徧，作圓相一帀。次加持花米，成光明\n種。如用之時，悉成如意珍寶供具。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念真言時，以右手拈花米三次畢，次手拈花米放\n曼拏囉上，右旋灑散，如空注雨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次排列花米位，從中央起"}
