{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三徧畢，撒花米，撫尺一下，念云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唵啞吽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唵啞吽"}
