{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唵啞吽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宣意畢，舉云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其印呪者，甘露軍茶利菩薩念誦儀云：二手內相\n义，直豎二頭指，並以二中指纏二頭指初節前，各\n頭相拄，二大指並伸直，結印當心。誦呪曰："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
